"Connection: keep-alive\n"
"X-Forwarded-For: <client>\n"
"X-Forwarded-Proto: <scheme>\n"
"X-Real-IP: <client>\n"
"X-Sibuna-Status: PASS\n"
"X-Sibuna-Rule: session | robots-txt | ip/cidr-trie | ..."
msgstr ""
"Connection: keep-alive\n"
"X-Forwarded-For: <client>\n"
