#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:643
msgid ""
"Publication of a complete engine, and one connection's view of it. In "
"``cmd/sibuna/src/slot.rs`` (crate ``sibuna``)."
msgstr ""
"पूरे इंजन का प्रकाशन, और एक कनेक्शन की ओर से उसका दृश्य। "
